主題分享更多資訊嗎？",null,[[[["E:OTHER_DIETARY_RESTRICTIONS"],"特殊餐點",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjb79vBxNKWAxWxna8BHZQIH0UQ3YcHCLABKAA"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjb79vBxNKWAxWxna8BHZQIH0UQ3IcHCK8BKA4",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["20260412 [首刷]\n本次評價『好吃』👍👍\n\n[鹽味拉麵+雙倍肉] 165+45\n清爽的鹽味湯頭，配點洋蔥和蔥花蠻好喝的。麗珠製麵的口感稍微軟一些，面量也偏少。\n舒肥雞好吃，叉燒肉更棒，白菜吸了湯汁也很好吃。\n糖心蛋要額外點歐。\n\n[韓國牡春限定] 240\n湯頭有加了酒，所以味道微醺微醺很不錯，也蠻濃郁的，我喜歡。\n這碗我選擇立成製麵，細麵的口感比較有嚼勁，也不錯。\n\n[泡菜] 40\n店員說不會辣所以吃看看，還真的不會辣(不然就尷尬了)。\n\n_____________心得文______________\n去年就看到永和開了一家長生塩人，但是拉麵清單排到今天才家吃看看。最近忙忙碌碌壓力大，吃碗拉麵發洩發洩~\n\n我個人喜歡限定款，味道比較濃郁和特殊，配上立成製麵的口感也很好，推薦給各位。\n兩碗吃完沒有吃太飽，食量大的人一定要加麵。",null,[0,24]]]],[null,1776043881000000,1776043881000000,"4 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfZzRucWxxOEdkLXN5R3YwS2ZDSjBEQQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfZzRucWxxOEdkLXN5R3YwS2ZDSjBEQRoTQ2d3STZZN3h6Z1lRemZmN2t3RQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjb79vBxNKWAxWxna8BHZQIH0UQ_2MIsQEoDw"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/17246566718008311156/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhzV0ZWWE9YaFlNVGxRVG01V05GRXpiRmxSYlZsNVVrVjRSMWRXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17246566718008311156/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhzV0ZWWE9YaFlNVGxRVG01V05GRXpiRmxSYlZsNVVrVjRSMWRXUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/17246566718008311156/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhzV0ZWWE9YaFlNVGxRVG01V05GRXpiRmxSYlZsNVVrVjRSMWRXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17246566718008311156/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhzV0ZWWE9YaFlNVGxRVG01V05GRXpiRmxSYlZsNVVrVjRSMWRXUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/17246566718008311156/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhzV0ZWWE9YaFlNVGxRVG01V05GRXpiRmxSYlZsNVVrVjRSMWRXUlJBQhAA",[