ZQIH0UQ3IcHCL4BKAY",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwjb79vBxNKWAxWxna8BHZQIH0UQ3IcHCL8BKAc",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_SEATING_TYPE"],"可選擇哪些類型的座位？",null,[[[["E:DINING_SEATING_TYPE_INDOOR_DINING_AREA"],"室內用餐區",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjb79vBxNKWAxWxna8BHZQIH0UQ3YcHCMEBKAA"],[["E:DINING_SEATING_TYPE_COUNTER_SEATING"],"吧台座位",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjb79vBxNKWAxWxna8BHZQIH0UQ3YcHCMIBKAE"]]],null,"座位類型",null,"0ahUKEwjb79vBxNKWAxWxna8BHZQIH0UQ3IcHCMABKAg",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["第一次前往現場用餐，一入店店主就用心的分享拉麵的特色以及限定菜色，並且小桌子上還記錄著湯頭是用什麼材料熬製的，非常用心，越看越餓🤤看的我好期待拉麵的味道。\n\n而拉麵果然完全沒有讓人失望。當天點了期間限定口味的「清邁湄平濃辣夏蟹」無比驚艷。柔軟的滑蛋包覆著有勁道的立成麵體讓人吃的一口接一口都忘記聊天。湯底非常香醇，搭配叉燒吃下肚只感覺幸福滿滿。\n非常感謝當天為我們煮麵的師傅特別幫家母煮的軟一點點，師傅非常貼心，媽媽吃完也很開心。\n下一次一定會再回訪。",null,[0,77]]]],[null,1783387585000000,1783387585000000,"1 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfeWJQdVIxcTJfeUZqTTFqbEVjNVYydw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfeWJQdVIxcTJfeUZqTTFqbEVjNVYydxoTQ2d3SXdhdXgwZ1lRenJIRHBBRQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjb79vBxNKWAxWxna8BHZQIH0UQ_2MIwwEoCQ"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/17246566718008311156/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVrUkdWWVFrWlhiVTVHVmtkU2ExVXhaM1JhUkVVd1YwVmpNMU5WUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17246566718008311156/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVrUkdWWVFrWlhiVTVHVmtkU2ExVXhaM1JhUkVVd1YwVmpNMU5WUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/17246566718008311156/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVrUkdWWVFrWlhiVTVHVmtkU2ExVXhaM1JhUkVVd1YwVmpNMU5WUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17246566718008311156/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVrUkdWWVFrWlhiVTVHVmtkU2ExVXhaM1JhUkVVd1YwVmpNMU5WUlJBQhAA"]